Acquired, shipped and refined are counted separately on purpose. A cell
that acquires and does not recover is a channel result; a cell that does
not acquire at all is usually the harness, and the peak level says which.
Shipped and refined come from the SAME capture, so their difference is the
estimator and nothing else.
